{"id":"cuivre","lemma":"cuivre","pos":"noun","rank":4779,"glosses":["copper","brass","copperplate"],"ipa":"/kɥivʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d8/Fr-cuivre.ogg/Fr-cuivre.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cuivres"},"formAudio":{"cuivres":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-cuivres.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le cuivre conduit bien l'électricité.","en":"Copper conducts electricity well.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to drive","l":"conduire"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"electricity"}]},{"text":"Le cuivre et l'argent sont deux métaux.","en":"Copper and silver are both metals.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"two"},{"g":"metal","l":"métal"}]},{"text":"L'or a une couleur similaire au cuivre.","en":"Gold is similar in color to brass.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"gold"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"color/colour"},{"g":"similar"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"L'aluminium ne conduit pas l'électricité aussi bien que le cuivre.","en":"Aluminum doesn't conduct electricity as well as copper does.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"aluminium"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to drive","l":"conduire"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"electricity"},{"g":"too, also, as well"},null,null,{"g":"the / it"},null],"phrases":[[8,10,"although"]]}]}